Device Usage adds a Reporting page that answers "how much internet did
this device use between two dates". It reads the NetFlow data already
collected by Reporting: Insight and attributes it to devices (MAC
addresses) using Kea DHCP reservations and leases, Hostwatch history and
a daily IP-to-device snapshot taken by cron. Download, upload and total
are reported separately, per device and optionally per day, with CSV
export. LAN-to-LAN traffic, broadcast and multicast are excluded.

Requirements: Reporting: NetFlow with local capture ("Insight") enabled
on the LAN interface. For upload accounting on a bridged LAN, add the
bridge member interfaces to the NetFlow capture as well.

